  "description": "Colourful Christmas – A Bright and Fun Digital Pattern Collection\nBring a touch of whimsical fun to your creative projects with the Colourful Christmas digital pattern collection! This set of 10 bright seamless digital patterns features xmas string lights, fun lettering (’tis the season, merry & bright), stripes and polka dots, perfect for bringing energy and personality to any creative project.\nFeaturing a vibrant and bold palette of bright green, red, pink and teal, these patterns are ideal for scrapbooking, party printables, fabric design, Christmas decor, stationery, and more. These are perfect for any Holiday Season project.\nAll files are seamless, allowing you to tile them effortlessly to create larger prints without losing quality.\nThis product comes in 1 Zipped folder (31.4 MB) and includes:\n• 10 High Quality SEAMLESS Digital Paper Patterns\n• High Resolution (300 dpi) for crisp, professional-quality prints\n• Each file is 12 x 12 inches (305 x 305 mm | 3600 x 3600 pixels)\nFile Formats:\n• 10 PNG files in RGB – Ideal for digital use\n• 10 JPEG files in CMYK – Perfect for printing\nPLEASE NOTE:\n• For best results, use the JPEG files for printing and PNG files for digital use\n• If you’re sending your files to a print shop, confirm their preferred file format\n• Colours may vary slightly due to different screen and printer settings\nThank you for stopping by! Feel free to check out my entire shop, Creative Wolf Design!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Colourful Christmas – A Bright and Fun Digital Pattern Collection</p>\n<p>Bring a touch of whimsical fun to your creative projects with the Colourful Christmas digital pattern collection! This set of 10 bright seamless digital patterns features xmas string lights, fun lettering (’tis the season, merry &amp; bright), stripes and polka dots, perfect for bringing energy and personality to any creative project.</p>\n<p>Featuring a vibrant and bold palette of bright green, red, pink and teal, these patterns are ideal for scrapbooking, party printables, fabric design, Christmas decor, stationery, and more. These are perfect for any Holiday Season project.</p>\n<p>All files are seamless, allowing you to tile them effortlessly to create larger prints without losing quality.</p>\n<p>This product comes in 1 Zipped folder (31.4 MB) and includes:<br>\n• 10 High Quality SEAMLESS Digital Paper Patterns<br>\n• High Resolution (300 dpi) for crisp, professional-quality prints<br>\n• Each file is 12 x 12 inches (305 x 305 mm | 3600 x 3600 pixels)</p>\n<p>File Formats:<br>\n• 10 PNG files in RGB – Ideal for digital use<br>\n• 10 JPEG files in CMYK – Perfect for printing</p>\n<p>PLEASE NOTE:<br>\n• For best results, use the JPEG files for printing and PNG files for digital use<br>\n• If you’re sending your files to a print shop, confirm their preferred file format<br>\n• Colours may vary slightly due to different screen and printer settings</p>\n<p>Thank you for stopping by! Feel free to check out my entire shop, Creative Wolf Design!</p>",
